  "summary": "Vo1d is a large-scale Android TV botnet that uses DGA seeds to compute C2 domains and beacons to cloud-hosted infrastructure over non-standard high ports (TCP 55520/55521). The same report page also details CikaBika Bot, a Nim loader that sideloads a Rust RAT as dbghelp.dll into Microsoft Edge, uses Discord channels for C2, and exfiltrates via ngrok. Detection anchors include DGA domains sharing the seed suffixes 60b33d7929a and fc975904fc9, Vo1d C2 hosts, and CikaBika's Discord command set and Edge DLL-planting paths.",
